Restores the reset branch of `FolderState::applied` as it was before
0ae55b1: a reset that lands only re-considers the entries deferred at its
path and adopts nothing, so the record `revert` restored keeps its old
`seq` and the landing is never announced. A peer that asked while the
reset was pending was refused, and it never hears that this machine can
serve the file again (DESIGN.md §7.1, §8.3 step 2).

